    "text": "For every live response, set expiry from the Expires header or now plus one hour. Set nextAttempt from numeric Retry-After for status 429, defaulting to 60 seconds and enforcing a 60-second minimum; for other statuses set nextAttempt to expiry. These updates occur before the 304 and accepted-status branches."
